---

<section class="hero">
	<div class="container hero-inner">
		<h1>探索我们的产品</h1>
		<p>高品质产品，为您的生活带来更多可能</p>
		<a href="/products" class="btn btn-primary">浏览全部产品</a>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero {
		padding: 80px 0;
		background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
	}

	.hero-inner {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}

	.hero p {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		max-width: 480px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.hero {
			padding: 48px 0;
		}

		.hero h1 {
			font-size: 1.75rem;
		}
	}
</style>
